{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intel reveals new heat-tempered cosmetics from AdvantEDGE are inbound. Forged in fire, tempered for combat\u2014these skins radiate with chromatic intensity. Each piece is heat-treated to give your arsenal a brilliant, battle-hardened shine. Prepare to turn up the heat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intel reveals new heat tempered cosmetics from AdvantEDGE are inbound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forged in Fire, Tempered for combat. These skins are heat-treated to add shine to your arsenal. The intensity of the forge emanates from this Chromatic Heat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The New Skins(s) are for the following items:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">M249 SAW Light Machine Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barrett M107A1 Sniper Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AK5C Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AK74U Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FN FAL Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galil Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SKS Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCAR-L Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MP5 Submachine Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MP5K Submachine Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glock 17 Pistol and</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Blicky&quot; Glock 17 Pistol</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skins can be applied at any time at the skin application booth in your bunker. Note: This is an in-app purchase, it cannot be refunded and content is consumed at purchase.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828690?t=1753881679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828690?t=1753881679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828690